WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.136 --> 00:00:04.279
- [Narrator] Winchester Mystery House

00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:07.519
in San Jose, California is
one of the most haunted places

00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:08.436
in America.

00:00:10.986 --> 00:00:12.335
- Winchester Mystery House

00:00:12.335 --> 00:00:15.735
is a incredibly unique Victorian mansion

00:00:15.735 --> 00:00:17.635
created by Sarah Winchester,

00:00:17.635 --> 00:00:20.605
heiress to the Winchester
Repeating Arms fortune.

00:00:20.605 --> 00:00:22.626
- [Narrator] Sarah Winchester had a series

00:00:22.626 --> 00:00:24.904
of unfortunate things happen to her,

00:00:24.904 --> 00:00:28.247
including the death of
her husband and daughter.

00:00:28.247 --> 00:00:31.154
She was a spiritualist
and visited a medium

00:00:31.154 --> 00:00:33.786
to try and understand why.

00:00:33.786 --> 00:00:36.095
- The medium said, well,
the gun that won the west,

00:00:36.095 --> 00:00:38.485
there's a lot of karma there, so head west

00:00:38.485 --> 00:00:41.312
and build a house to
appease these spirits.

00:00:41.312 --> 00:00:43.495
She started construction in 1884,

00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:46.765
which didn't stop till the day she died.

00:00:46.765 --> 00:00:49.925
The house is a 160 room Victorian mansion

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:51.586
with no master plan.

00:00:51.586 --> 00:00:54.095
There's a lot of strange attributes.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:59.066
There's 40 staircases, 40
fireplaces, four elevators.

00:00:59.066 --> 00:01:00.615
We have a number of staircases

00:01:00.615 --> 00:01:02.655
that lead right to the ceiling.

00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:06.546
Doors that open up into
nothing, or it's just a wall.

00:01:06.546 --> 00:01:08.855
- [Narrator] The house
is known for its spirits,

00:01:08.855 --> 00:01:11.274
who many people believe
are the ghosts of people

00:01:11.274 --> 00:01:15.164
who worked at the house
or even Sarah herself.

00:01:15.164 --> 00:01:16.763
- A lot of our guests and employees

00:01:16.763 --> 00:01:20.514
have had very strange things
happen to them in this house.

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:24.234
Sometimes it's just
footsteps or hearing a voice,

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:25.906
a light that flickers,

00:01:25.906 --> 00:01:30.074
or sometimes it's an actual
full, physical manifestation.

00:01:30.074 --> 00:01:32.939
If we haven't solved the
mysteries in 93 years,

00:01:32.939 --> 00:01:35.772
then I don't know if we ever will.

